{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Crawl: Assemble Your Trio and Conquer the Depths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A command-based dungeon crawler where you build a team of three adventurers to challenge a randomly generated labyrinth. Each run offers a new layout, with unpredictable item spawns, equipment drops, and buffs to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three character types \u2014 <strong>Balanced</strong>, <strong>Explorer</strong>, or <strong>Combat Specialist</strong> \u2014 and select a weapon class: <strong>Swordsman</strong>, <strong>Archer</strong>, or <strong>Mage</strong>. Strengthen your party through <strong>item synthesis</strong>, <strong>skill acquisition</strong>, and <strong>leveling up</strong> as you descend ever deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle monsters, gather treasure, and defeat the final boss awaiting on the lowest floor to claim your place among the high scorers. Every decision counts in this roguelike adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618720?t=1747862255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618720?t=1747862255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618720/bba9b20a30d138122f80c0c32cfabc546d6a39ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747862255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618720/bba9b20a30d138122f80c0c32cfabc546d6a39ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747862255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Crawl: Assemble Your Trio and Conquer the Depths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A command-based dungeon crawler where you build a team of three adventurers to challenge a randomly generated labyrinth. Each run offers a new layout, with unpredictable item spawns, equipment drops, and buffs to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three character types \u2014 <strong>Balanced</strong>, <strong>Explorer</strong>, or <strong>Combat Specialist</strong> \u2014 and select a weapon class: <strong>Swordsman</strong>, <strong>Archer</strong>, or <strong>Mage</strong>. Strengthen your party through <strong>item synthesis</strong>, <strong>skill acquisition</strong>, and <strong>leveling up</strong> as you descend ever deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle monsters, gather treasure, and defeat the final boss awaiting on the lowest floor to claim your place among the high scorers. Every decision counts in this roguelike adventure.</p>","developers":["KusanohitoCreative"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618720/d648e03b8c189b3787c2a31280ba8662ea444929/header.jpg?t=1747862255","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134631,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134631/movie480.mp4?t=1747379212","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134631/movie_max.mp4?t=1747379212"},"name":"Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134631/54a9d5e776a6847fa143f66e921b22d708b2e1ae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747379212","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.s